### Contoh request. Di VS Code butuh ekstensi "REST Client" (humao.rest-client).

@host = http://localhost:5095

### Cek server
GET {{host}}/api/health

### Daftar
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "kamu@example.com", "password": "rahasia123" }

### Login → salin accessToken ke variabel @token di bawah
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "kamu@example.com", "password": "rahasia123" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Info user
GET {{host}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Push satu dompet
POST {{host}}/api/sync/push
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "wallets": [
    {
      "id": "6f1c1f9e-1b7a-4c7e-9a52-3f1d2b8f0001",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-08T01:00:00Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-08T01:00:00Z",
      "deletedAt": null,
      "name": "Tunai",
      "type": "cash",
      "openingBalance": 100000,
      "color": null,
      "sortOrder": 0,
      "isArchived": false
    }
  ]
}

### Pull semua perubahan
GET {{host}}/api/sync/pull?since=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
